NC Digital designs custom websites for businesses in Barry — hand-coded, mobile-first sites built to rank on Google and convert visitors into enquiries.

## Web design built for Barry businesses

Barry is the Vale of Glamorgan's largest town, with a diverse mix of trades, retail, hospitality, and professional services. Whether you're based in the town centre, Barry Island, or the surrounding area — a professional website is essential for standing out and winning local work.

We design from scratch, no templates. Every site is fast, mobile-friendly, and structured for SEO from the first page.

## What's included in every web design project

- Bespoke design based on your brand and goals
- Mobile-first, tested across all screen sizes and browsers
- On-page SEO — titles, meta descriptions, heading structure, schema markup
- Contact forms with spam protection
- Google Analytics and Search Console connected
- SSL certificate and security hardening included

